window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Murder, blood magic, and one dangerously hot vampire—some secrets refuse to stay buried. When a murder victim leaves Claire Benolt a chilling message scrawled in blood, her world shatters. Suddenly, she's being hunted by a faceless enemy, drawn into a shadowy world of supernatural secrets and ancient vendettas.</p> <p>The deeper she digs, the more questions arise—starting with the mysterious disappearance of her long-lost father. But nothing is more dangerous than the vampire who keeps showing up to save her life… and steal her heart. Dark, alluring, and hiding secrets of his own, he may be the only one who can keep her alive—or be the one who destroys her.</p> <p>With time running out and bodies piling up, Claire must face the truth: some monsters wear beautiful faces…and some truths are written in blood.</p>"; 
